# Living architecture doc

`docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` is the canonical product/architecture doc for this repo.

## Required

- Read `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` (especially **Status**) before non-trivial work.
- When you change behavior, domain model, stack, UI structure, or deferred scope, update `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md` in the **same** change.
- Keep the Status block current: Last updated, Implemented, In progress, Next, Deferred.
- Prefer amending Architecture over creating new design markdown files. Link from Architecture if a split is necessary.
- `README.md` is install/run only.
- If `.cursor/plans/` diverges from Architecture, Architecture wins — sync or drop the plan.

## Do not

- Leave the only design copy in `.cursor/plans/`
- Commit secrets or access tokens into docs (env var names only)
